WEBVTT

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.740
Retreat! Fall back!

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:26.200
What the--?!

00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:32.450
Huh? What is this?!

00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:35.490
What's happening to me?!

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:57.410
Uh, um...

00:00:57.410 --> 00:01:03.160
Somebody help me! How do I get down from here?!

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:05.200
That voice... Elsha?

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:07.870
Oh? She's not half bad.

00:01:07.870 --> 00:01:11.330
I don't think so! I didn't sign up for this!

00:01:11.330 --> 00:01:13.330
Hold your horses!

00:01:13.330 --> 00:01:16.490
I always wanted to say that!

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:50.770
Does a Huge Ship Bring Hope?

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:54.080
Does a Huge Ship Bring Hope?

00:02:57.320 --> 00:03:01.410
Republic of Rekka, Audience Chamber

00:02:57.370 --> 00:03:01.450
May the emperor and World Wall prosper forever!

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:06.200
May the emperor and World Wall prosper forever!

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:09.870
Excellent work recovering the Rakuho

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:13.790
and getting rid of Lutoh.

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:16.830
Your praise is an honor, Your Majesty.

00:03:16.830 --> 00:03:19.160
Well done, Your Majesty.

00:03:19.160 --> 00:03:25.240
With this many Bind Warpers,
Lutoh will fall behind us in power.

00:03:25.240 --> 00:03:27.910
Give our soldiers the armbands!

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:33.450
Troops! Equip your Bind Warpers!

00:03:34.870 --> 00:03:37.290
Manifest Armor...

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:40.830
These armbands manifest your conviction!

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:43.450
Warriors of Rekka!

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:48.660
Show me, Zetsu Daidan,
the depths of your conviction!

00:03:53.660 --> 00:03:55.870
Ours are all the same, too?

00:03:55.870 --> 00:04:01.870
Of course. Standing before the emperor,
loyalty is one's conviction.

00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:07.740
Identical conviction makes identical
Briheights and excellent soldiers.

00:04:07.740 --> 00:04:08.700
Kai.

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:09.830
Yes?

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:16.240
Was not your Briheight
different from the others?

00:04:16.240 --> 00:04:19.120
You bestowed it the name "Gigan."

00:04:19.120 --> 00:04:23.490
There are few who blatantly show
their conviction before me.

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:26.580
It shows one's capacity as general.

00:04:26.580 --> 00:04:27.950
Yes, sir!

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:32.580
However, what of the second Rakuho?

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:35.370
Huh? What are you referring to?

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:40.620
You don't know Shu Bi went after
a Rakuho, Prime Minister?

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:43.330
Well, I...

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:49.330
Let Shu Bi know I'm waiting for his report, Kai.

00:04:49.330 --> 00:04:50.410
Yes, sir!

00:04:57.160 --> 00:04:58.490
I'm free!

00:04:59.330 --> 00:05:01.620
Yippee!

00:05:01.620 --> 00:05:05.450
Huh? What? Is it coming to a stop?

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:11.660
A guy in a Rakuho?! Briheights?!
And what's this about a dreadnought?!

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:13.990
Ren! You even tattled about that?

00:05:13.990 --> 00:05:15.990
I'm sorry, but it was simply--

00:05:15.990 --> 00:05:19.660
Don't take it out on Ren! What are you hiding?!

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:22.450
I'm unsure, hence my investigation.

00:05:22.450 --> 00:05:26.870
It seems there's a lot more
to this floating fortress.

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:29.830
It may just destroy the world.

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:30.660
What?

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:33.330
Or so I read in the banned texts.

00:05:33.330 --> 00:05:37.580
What?! You entered the banned texts archive?!

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:43.080
Don't get cheeky, Shu.
We grew up near the north wall.

00:05:43.080 --> 00:05:47.700
We came from nearly nothing
and worked hard to get where we are.

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:50.450
Some would love to see you gone.

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:53.660
You mean that hopeless prime minister?

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:58.240
You and I will change Rekka together.
Don't forget our promise.

00:05:58.240 --> 00:06:03.160
Of course not. But is that something
you want Ren to hear?

00:06:05.910 --> 00:06:09.370
You and Ren Sin are like two peas in a pod.

00:06:09.370 --> 00:06:11.200
So he says, Ren.

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:13.490
Huh? No, that's--

00:06:13.490 --> 00:06:17.410
Hurry up and get hitched
'cuz I worry about your future.

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:22.620
General, you're mistaken!
I'm only with him because it's my duty!

00:06:22.620 --> 00:06:25.120
Yeah, yeah. Say no more.

00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:28.200
Shu, don't upset His Majesty again.

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:33.290
I know. He can be frightening,
so I'll report to him soon.

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:36.080
Good. And be quick about it.

00:06:37.950 --> 00:06:39.790
Be quick about it.

00:06:41.370 --> 00:06:43.040
Um...

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:47.830
Ignore what he said. He doesn't know
the first thing about romance.

00:06:47.830 --> 00:06:50.410
You speak as if you do.

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:52.700
I just have no interest in it.

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:06.740
C'mon, let's depart after we eat!
This whopper can reach the wall easy!

00:07:06.740 --> 00:07:09.490
Still going on about that?

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:12.410
Well, only your Briheight makes it move!

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:16.410
Gimme a break! Our village
is gone thanks to you!

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:18.790
Well, uh...

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:23.040
I feel bad about that. I'm really sorry.

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:25.740
But even so, I've gotta go back.

00:07:25.740 --> 00:07:30.490
Talking with Shu, I realized
I can't scale the wall alone!

00:07:30.490 --> 00:07:35.490
But I can with the help of my friends!
My friends from Edger Village!

00:07:35.490 --> 00:07:40.870
Since when did we become friends?
And who is this Shu?

00:07:40.870 --> 00:07:43.330
Not sure, but he's annoying.

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:46.410
Huh? I can't even...

00:07:46.410 --> 00:07:47.950
Hey, Elsha!

00:07:47.950 --> 00:07:49.990
Elsha's a tough one.

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:54.240
You think she'd be exhausted
after moving that big thing.

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:58.830
Growing up in the frontier
makes us pretty rugged.

00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:01.790
You're fairly new here, but you'll learn.

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:03.370
I suppose.

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:06.870
Did you learn anything about him?

00:08:06.870 --> 00:08:13.700
I haven't had much chance, but other than
his memories, he seems just fine.

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:17.120
A thorough exam might tell us more.

00:08:17.120 --> 00:08:20.040
No need for that. Besides,

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:24.490
his delusion about being from
beyond the wall is the real problem.

00:08:24.490 --> 00:08:25.490
True.

00:08:29.120 --> 00:08:32.120
I see! That might just work!

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:32.820
Right?

00:08:32.820 --> 00:08:34.330
Yeah! It's perfect!

00:08:34.330 --> 00:08:37.700
Bit? What are you doing with the hostage?

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:38.830
Atlee!

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:40.870
Go get the chief and the others!

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:41.580
Huh?

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:44.330
You're all gonna want to hear this!

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:48.490
We wouldn't want Commander Tyrone
to be stuck here forever!

00:08:49.410 --> 00:08:53.990
Luckily, I stumbled across
the patriot, Bit Namital.

00:08:53.990 --> 00:08:56.830
Lady, this guy will be a hero.

00:08:56.830 --> 00:08:58.620
R-Right...

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:02.240
Yeah. Thank you.

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:07.910
Chief Burk, I promise your people's safety.

00:09:07.910 --> 00:09:09.540
I'll be taking that.

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:13.580
You truly are a patriot, Bit Namital.

00:09:13.580 --> 00:09:16.200
Yup! You've got that right!

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:19.040
You guys planning to eat me again?

00:09:19.040 --> 00:09:24.290
In exchange for a new place to live,
we're turning you in.

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:27.910
The president promised in front of everyone.

00:09:27.910 --> 00:09:31.830
But I inherited the spirit
of the former sheriff.

00:09:31.830 --> 00:09:33.990
Shut up about the undies!

00:09:33.990 --> 00:09:35.080
You, too?

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:37.790
Arrow, I... I...

00:09:37.790 --> 00:09:40.870
You think we'd let you become a sheriff?

00:09:40.870 --> 00:09:45.290
Besides, we have no choice!
Edger Village is gone!

00:09:45.290 --> 00:09:48.120
Put your hands up and roll over!

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:50.870
Yeah, yeah.

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:09.740
Untie him.

00:10:09.740 --> 00:10:11.200
A-Atlee?

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:13.790
Untie Arrow! Hurry!

00:10:13.790 --> 00:10:15.830
Wh-What are you saying?

00:10:15.830 --> 00:10:20.370
You're okay with sacrificing
someone for a new start?

00:10:20.370 --> 00:10:22.540
Just look at our village!

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:24.410
It was Arrow who saved us!

00:10:24.410 --> 00:10:28.290
Not just me, but everyone!
So I'm saving him, too!

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:29.660
A-Atlee!

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:32.700
I don't wanna hurt you! Untie him!

00:10:32.700 --> 00:10:34.540
Drop the gun, Atlee.

00:10:35.490 --> 00:10:37.160
Bit is right.

00:10:37.160 --> 00:10:39.200
Sacrifice is a part of life.

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:39.870
But--!

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:46.240
Tyrone said they'll hand him over
to Lutoh, not that they'll kill him.

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:49.910
And you believe him? He tried to kill me!

00:10:49.910 --> 00:10:53.330
Enough. Don't bother, Atlee.

00:10:53.330 --> 00:10:55.910
I appreciate it, but I won't run away.

00:10:55.910 --> 00:10:57.540
But, at this rate--!

00:10:57.540 --> 00:11:00.160
If I ran, they'd blame you.

00:11:01.910 --> 00:11:07.620
I wanna go beyond the wall,
but I don't want to make anyone suffer.

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:09.660
We have, though! Plenty!

00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:13.330
And because you think that, I'm doing this.

00:11:13.330 --> 00:11:17.080
It's fine. No hard feelings. But...

00:11:18.200 --> 00:11:20.410
Elsha, what's your dream?

00:11:20.410 --> 00:11:21.330
Huh?

00:11:21.330 --> 00:11:26.290
Protecting the village?
What if that guy is lying to you?

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:31.120
Not much we can do.
We're just a pesky little village.

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:37.370
But only you can move that behemoth.
You guys have a power you never had.

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:39.950
So you want me to blow up the wall?

00:11:39.950 --> 00:11:43.870
Pathetic. You're just pushing
your own plans on me.

00:11:43.870 --> 00:11:47.700
That's right, I am. Is that so wrong?

00:11:47.700 --> 00:11:50.870
Of course it is! Think of
other people's feelings!

00:11:50.870 --> 00:11:56.790
Would that change anything?
Is your conviction swayed by other people?

00:11:58.370 --> 00:12:03.990
It seems I don't have conviction,
but I refuse to deceive myself.

00:12:03.990 --> 00:12:06.990
I'm a guy who doesn't know who he is.

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:11.450
If I ignore my gut feelings,
I'll truly have nothing at all.

00:12:13.910 --> 00:12:17.580
The prow of that whopper sure is high.

00:12:18.580 --> 00:12:21.160
Bet it's got a nice view.

00:12:21.160 --> 00:12:24.700
Elsha, how'd it feel way up there?

00:12:33.240 --> 00:12:36.080
Perfect! Everyone's aboard!

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:41.740
The president's waiting at Desert Town!
Your new village lies just beyond!

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:43.790
Yeah! Let's roll!

00:12:43.790 --> 00:12:46.370
Bit always gets carried away.

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:49.290
Time to go to our new home.

00:13:02.450 --> 00:13:06.370
There wasn't much to love about it, but...

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:09.080
Farewell, Edger Village!

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:11.830
Bye-bye!

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:17.330
Never been this far out.

00:13:17.330 --> 00:13:18.620
Me, too.

00:13:19.740 --> 00:13:23.040
Whatever happens, it's not my fault.

00:13:23.040 --> 00:13:27.700
Warper... Warper... Bind Warper...

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:27.700
Arrow's Warper!

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:33.370
Don't get any ideas, Atlee.
I know you tried, but he won't run.

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:35.870
You'd just be wasting your time.

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:37.330
Bit...

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:37.790
Huh?

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:38.870
I'm disappointed.

00:13:38.870 --> 00:13:40.830
Huh? Why?

00:13:40.830 --> 00:13:45.200
It'll work out! Everyone will be happy!
Don't you understand?

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:46.870
I'll never understand!

00:13:46.870 --> 00:13:48.080
Huh?

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:55.540
All I ever do is live in regret,
unable to help those who've helped me.

00:14:05.450 --> 00:14:08.200
To think it would be this big...

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:13.620
This is Back Arrow.
He was the guy in the Rakuho.

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:17.080
And here's his Bind Warper.

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:18.910
Good work, Tyrone.

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:23.790
Welcome, Edger Village!

00:14:23.790 --> 00:14:28.200
I'm sorry you've been stuck
in the sticks for so long!

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:31.950
Behold! This is your new village!

00:14:35.160 --> 00:14:40.120
It's overflowing with bountiful land,
water, forests, and sky!

00:14:40.120 --> 00:14:46.120
All of this will be yours! The promised land
is just beyond that canyon!

00:14:47.370 --> 00:14:51.040
Now, go! Claim your paradise!

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:56.450
Mr. President! Will this man be executed?

00:14:56.450 --> 00:15:01.660
We're handing him over to Lutoh
and that's all. Don't sweat it.

00:15:01.660 --> 00:15:03.240
Hear that, Arrow?

00:15:03.240 --> 00:15:07.370
Yup! I'll take care of myself, so don't worry.

00:15:07.370 --> 00:15:09.830
The last thing I am is worried.

00:15:12.950 --> 00:15:16.160
Commander Tyrone! Let me join the military!

00:15:16.160 --> 00:15:18.700
Huh? What's this now?

00:15:19.790 --> 00:15:22.700
Atlee hates me now anyway...

00:15:22.700 --> 00:15:25.330
I wanna start down a new path!

00:15:29.450 --> 00:15:34.200
Bit Namital. Give your friends
a farewell gun salute.

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:37.120
Right! Take care, guys!

00:15:38.990 --> 00:15:40.040
Huh?!

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:49.160
Yeah! Blow up the whole canyon!
Bury the ship under a pile of rocks!

00:15:53.490 --> 00:15:55.410
Huh? What?!

00:16:01.790 --> 00:16:02.480
Guys!

00:16:02.480 --> 00:16:04.660
Don't move, kiddo!

00:16:04.660 --> 00:16:06.330
They'll be buried alive!

00:16:06.330 --> 00:16:09.660
It's a necessary evil to save Iki Territory.

00:16:09.660 --> 00:16:15.740
The existence of Edger Village
and that ship must be wiped from history.

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:16.830
Why?!

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:22.540
If Rekka or Lutoh learn of that weapon,
they'll attack without hesitation.

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:26.830
And if we hand it to one side,
the other will hate us.

00:16:26.830 --> 00:16:32.660
They must be erased from existence
for the sake of Iki Territory.

00:16:32.660 --> 00:16:34.660
Brilliant, Mr. President!

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:39.990
When I contacted you,
you read my mind and went with the flow.

00:16:39.990 --> 00:16:41.330
You tricked me!

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:44.290
But you're a fool for being tricked.

00:16:45.410 --> 00:16:47.990
I've always wanted to say that!

00:16:47.990 --> 00:16:52.120
Anything to save the country. That's politics.

00:16:54.580 --> 00:16:59.830
They're all gonna die?
They'll be killed? You're kidding!

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:02.540
Man, you guys are pathetic!

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:04.540
Shut your mouth!

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:08.120
D-Don't kill him! Lutoh wants him alive!

00:17:08.120 --> 00:17:09.200
I know.

00:17:09.200 --> 00:17:13.540
Aim for this idiot! Send him to see his pals!

00:17:13.540 --> 00:17:14.420
Yes, sir!

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:15.080
Damn you!

00:17:15.080 --> 00:17:16.870
Farewell, patrio--

00:17:17.990 --> 00:17:20.120
Dammit! You little--

00:17:22.160 --> 00:17:24.700
Whoa! You rotten bumpkin!

00:17:25.740 --> 00:17:28.160
You're right, I am a bumpkin!

00:17:28.160 --> 00:17:30.620
And I've got sticky fingers, too!

00:17:31.740 --> 00:17:32.400
You scoundrel!

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:34.700
Brat!

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:36.490
Arrow!

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:41.580
I know it's selfish after what I've done,
but you're our only hope!

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:46.540
Save Edger Village! Save everybody!

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:48.660
I've heard you loud and clear!

00:17:48.660 --> 00:17:50.330
Manifest Armor...

00:17:54.950 --> 00:17:59.830
It's already too late to save the village!
Think of the country!

00:17:59.830 --> 00:18:03.200
Old man, I've heard enough of your nonsense!

00:18:08.790 --> 00:18:10.410
Huh? Arrow!

00:18:12.490 --> 00:18:16.490
What's up, Elsha? Your ship run aground?

00:18:16.490 --> 00:18:19.660
Why are you here? We sold you out!

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:23.370
Bit asked me to come. Would've anyway, though.

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:24.290
Huh?

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:26.700
You think I'd abandon my friends?

00:18:26.700 --> 00:18:28.240
You'll save us?

00:18:28.240 --> 00:18:33.910
Only you can save yourself.
But I think I can help you out.

00:18:33.910 --> 00:18:36.910
What is it you want, Elsha?!

00:18:57.330 --> 00:18:59.410
Whoa!

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:04.950
Impossible!

00:19:04.950 --> 00:19:10.080
Gimme the Warper and let me at 'em!
I'll sink the ship and capture Arrow!

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:12.910
We only have so many. Be careful.

00:19:12.910 --> 00:19:14.870
Yes, sir!

00:19:14.870 --> 00:19:19.330
Manifest Armor...

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:19.330
If it's for the sake of Iki...!

00:19:20.160 --> 00:19:24.160
...I will go!

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:27.870
Huh? What?!

00:19:27.870 --> 00:19:29.830
Manifest Armor...

00:19:27.870 --> 00:19:29.830
You're persistent!

00:19:29.830 --> 00:19:31.790
Let me take him on!

00:19:31.790 --> 00:19:35.580
Lady, your conviction can't defeat me!

00:19:35.580 --> 00:19:38.540
I'll never forgive you!

00:19:38.540 --> 00:19:39.830
Gotcha!

00:19:39.830 --> 00:19:44.700
Don't you get it?! Your conviction
is no match for me!

00:19:53.910 --> 00:19:55.160
Atlee!

00:19:55.160 --> 00:19:56.990
Nice! Well done!

00:19:56.990 --> 00:20:00.290
My conviction is "I'll manage somehow!"

00:20:03.620 --> 00:20:07.200
Compared to what Elsha endured, this is nothing!

00:20:08.740 --> 00:20:09.870
What?!

00:20:09.870 --> 00:20:12.240
You roped the wrong person!

00:20:12.240 --> 00:20:14.870
But I won't kill you. Arrow, you're up!

00:20:14.870 --> 00:20:16.240
Here we go!

00:20:22.740 --> 00:20:25.240
You made fools of everyone!

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:29.120
You stomped on their dreams!
You crushed their hopes!

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:32.330
If you come back, I'll pulverize you!

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:40.240
The next time you mess with
Edger Village, you're done for!

00:20:40.240 --> 00:20:43.330
We'll fight and we won't hold back!

00:20:43.330 --> 00:20:44.990
Yeah! We're serious!

00:20:44.990 --> 00:20:48.790
Fine. We won't bother you guys anymore.

00:20:48.790 --> 00:20:51.540
So, please! Leave the country!

00:20:51.540 --> 00:20:52.700
Huh?

00:20:52.700 --> 00:20:55.830
If you guys stay, Iki is doomed!

00:20:55.830 --> 00:20:58.740
So the country is abandoning us?

00:21:00.660 --> 00:21:06.240
It's no big deal, Grandpa.
Edger was abandoned from the start.

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:11.080
But this time, we're gonna
abandon the country instead.

00:21:13.700 --> 00:21:18.080
When I stand on the prow,
I see how wide the world is.

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:21.080
I wanna see more and more of what lies beyond!

00:21:21.950 --> 00:21:27.410
And somewhere along the way,
we'll find a place we want to live.

00:21:27.410 --> 00:21:30.200
What's up, Bit? Still sulking?

00:21:30.200 --> 00:21:34.740
You were doing what you
thought best, and that's fine.

00:21:35.950 --> 00:21:40.620
Well, looks like this will be
our home for a while! Let's call it--

00:21:40.620 --> 00:21:45.410
Granedger! How's that? Let's call it Granedger!

00:21:49.830 --> 00:21:56.660
This man spouting nonsense about
beyond the wall will destroy Lingalind?

00:21:56.660 --> 00:21:58.990
Yes. So predictions say.

00:21:58.990 --> 00:22:03.450
Both the man and the dreadnought
must be eliminated.

00:22:03.450 --> 00:22:06.990
In that case, please leave the mission to me.

00:22:06.990 --> 00:22:08.160
What?!

00:22:08.160 --> 00:22:09.830
Oh?

00:22:09.830 --> 00:22:15.370
I, Shu Bi, will put my full mind
and might into eliminating them.

00:23:47.620 --> 00:23:52.070
Does Genius Come When Least Expected?
